\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3.2}{\ignorespaces Scheme depicting the effect of periodic boundary conditions. The image shows how a particle that at an instant \(t\) is displaced outside the original simulation space (black solid line), re-enters into the box from its periodic image at a time \(t + \Delta t\). The number of particles in the simulation cell and in all the periodic images are kept constant. Image generated with Matplotlib